  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended), or any Order revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification, the premises hereby approved shall be used solely for Class E(g)(i) (Offices to carry on any operational or administrative functions) and for no other purpose, including any other purpose falling within Class E of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure the retention of essential employment space and to prevent any alternative use within Class E that could cause harm to local residential amenity or highway safety.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Inlets and vents&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prior to the occupation of the development hereby approved, details of the positions of air intakes, vents and exhausts associated with any mechanical ventilation, air conditioning or any other ventilation system, supplying air to and extracting air from habitable rooms, shall be submitted for approval by the local planning authority. The development shall thereafter be implemented in accordance with the approved details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure acceptable air quality conditions for the protection of the health of future occupiers.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Ultra low NOx boilers&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All gas boilers used for space and hot water heating must achieve dry NOx emission rate equivalent to or less than 40 mg/kWh. Evidence to demonstrate that all installed boilers meet the required emissions standard must be provided to, and approved in writing by, the local planning authority prior to occupation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure the development is air quality neutral and to minimise the contribution of the development to background concentrations of NOx in the local environment.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The Class E(g)(i) commercial premises hereby approved shall be fitted out in full accordance with the details submitted prior to first occupation of the residential property hereby approved and shall not continue to be marketed other than in accordance with the submitted marketing strategy unless otherwise agreed in writing by the local planning authority. In the event that the approved fit out and marketing are unsuccessful in finding occupier/s then detailed further marketing actions will be required to be undertaken by the applicant to ensure appropriate Class E take-up of the premises to fulfil the mixed use proposal scheme which has been granted planning permission by the local planning authority.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON:&amp;nbsp;To ensure the timely delivery and long-term viability of the commercial element of the scheme, ensuring a genuine mixed-use development that contributes to local employment opportunities and economic vitality.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;i) All newly formed Class C3 premises shall be designed in accordance with BS8233:2014 &#x27;Guidance on sound insulation and noise reduction for buildings&#x27; to attain the following noise levels:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Resting (Living room): 35dB LAeq,16hrs (7am to 11pm);&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dining (Dining room/area): 40dB LAeq,16hrs (7am to 11pm);&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sleeping (Bedroom): 35dB LAeq,16hrs (7am to 11pm) and 30dB LAeq,8hrs (11pm to 7am).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No individual noise event (LAmax, measured with F time weighting) in bedrooms shall exceed 45dB at night.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ii) Prior to the occupation of the Class C3 premises, a test shall be carried out to show that the required noise levels have been met and the results submitted to the local planning authority for approval.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure a satisfactory standard of residential accommodation for future occupiers by mitigating the impacts of noise and disturbance.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E277&quot; id=&quot;E277&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Prior to commencement of development, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E278&quot; id=&quot;E278&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E279&quot; id=&quot;E279&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;soundproofing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E280&quot; id=&quot;E280&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;scheme for protecting the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E281&quot; id=&quot;E281&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;residential (noise sensitive) element of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E282&quot; id=&quot;E282&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;development &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E283&quot; id=&quot;E283&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;hereby approved &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E284&quot; id=&quot;E284&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;from the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E285&quot; id=&quot;E285&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Class E element of the development hereby approved shall be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E286&quot; id=&quot;E286&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt; submitted to and approved &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E287&quot; id=&quot;E287&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;in writing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E288&quot; id=&quot;E288&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;by the local planning authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E289&quot; id=&quot;E289&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.  The scheme &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E290&quot; id=&quot;E290&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;as approved &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E291&quot; id=&quot;E291&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;shall be implemented in full prior to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E292&quot; id=&quot;E292&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;first occupation of the residential (noise sensitive) element&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E293&quot; id=&quot;E293&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E294&quot; id=&quot;E294&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;of the approved development.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E294&quot; id=&quot;E294&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E294&quot; id=&quot;E294&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;REASON:&amp;nbsp;To protect future residential occupants from excessive noise and vibration arising from the adjoining Class E commercial premises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E269&quot; id=&quot;E269&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The development shall be carried out in accordance with the recommendations and noise mitigation measures as set out in the Environmental Noise Survey and Acoustic Design Statement Report prepared by Hann Tucker Associates dated 27 July 2022, ref; 29979/ADS1 accompanying the application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E269&quot; id=&quot;E269&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E269&quot; id=&quot;E269&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;REASON:&amp;nbsp;To mitigate the impact of noise from the development and ensure a satisfactory standard of acoustic privacy and comfort for occupants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span is=&quot;qowt-word-run&quot; qowt-eid=&quot;E270&quot; id=&quot;E270&quot; class=&quot;qowt-font4-Arial&quot; qowt-runtype=&quot;qowt-tab&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
